(315, 'about', 'About', 'about', '<i>prep.</i>', 'A*bout\"', '([uCode:?])', '[OE. <i>aboute</i>,\r <i>abouten</i>, <i>abuten</i>; AS. <i>[uCode:amacr]butan</i>, <i>onbutan</i>;\r <i>on</i> + <i>butan</i>, which is from <i>be</i> by + u<i>tan</i> outward,\r from <i>ut</i> out. See <u>But</u>, <u>Out</u>.]</p>\r \r <p>', 6, 0),
