(3475, 'amiable', 'Amiable', 'amiable', '<i>a.</i>', 'A\"mi*a*ble', '([uCode:?])', '[F. <i>amiable</i>, L.\r <i>amicabilis</i> friendly, fr. <i>amicus</i> friend, fr. <i>amare</i> to\r love. The meaning has been influenced by F. <i>aimable</i>, L.\r <i>amabilis</i> lovable, fr. <i>amare</i> to love. Cf. <u>Amicable</u>,\r <u>Amorous</u>, <u>', 48, 0),
