(10596, 'bissextile', 'Bissextile', 'bissextile', '<i>n.</i>', 'Bis*sex\"tile', '([uCode:?])', '[L. <i>bissextilis</i>\r annus, fr. <i>bissextus</i> (<i>bis</i> + <i>sextus</i> sixth, fr.\r <i>sex</i> six) the sixth of the calends of March, or twenty-fourth day of\r February, which was reckoned twice every fourth year, by the intercalation\r of a day.]', 149, 0),
