(13152, 'bulk', 'Bulk', 'bulk', '<i>n.</i>', 'Bulk', '(b[uCode:ubreve]lk)', '[OE. <i>bulke</i>,\r <i>bolke</i>, heap; cf. Dan. <i>bulk</i> lump, clod, OSw. <i>bolk</i>\r crowd, mass, Icel. <i>b[uCode:?]lkast</i> to be bulky. Cf. <u>Boll</u>,\r , <u>Bile</u> a boil, <u>Bulge</u>,\r ]', 190, 0),
