(13195, 'bullion', 'Bullion', 'bullion', '<i>n.</i>', 'Bul\"lion', '(b[uCode:usdot]l\"y[uCode:ubreve]n)', '[Cf. OE.\r <i>bullyon</i> a hook used for fastening the dress, a button, stud, an\r embossed ornament of various kinds, <i>e. g.</i>, on the cover of a book,\r on bridles or poitrels, for purses, for breeches and doublets, LL.\r <i>bullio</i> the swelling of', 191, 0),
