(17524, 'cinquecento', 'Cinquecento', 'cinquecento', '<i>n. [uCode: a.</i>', '||Cin`que*cen\"to', '(?)', '[It.,\r five hundred, abbrev. for fifteen hundred. The <i>Cinquecento</i>\r style was so called because it arose after the year 1500.]', 257, 0),
