(26917, 'diamond', 'Diamond', 'diamond', '<i>n.</i>', 'Di\"a*mond', '(?; 277)', '[OE.\r <i>diamaund</i>, <i>diamaunt</i>, F. <i>diamant</i>, corrupted, fr.\r L. <i>adamas</i>, the hardest iron, steel, diamond, Gr. [uCode:?]. Perh.\r the corruption is due to the influence of Gr. [uCode:?] transparent. See\r <u>Adamant</u>, <u>Tame</u>.]', 406, 0),
