(27236, 'dig', 'Dig', 'dig', '<i>v. t.</i>', 'Dig', '(d[uCode:ibreve]g)', '[<pos><i>imp. [uCode:\r p. p.</i></pos> <u>Dug</u> (d&ubreve]g) or <u>Digged</u>\r (d[uCode:ibreve]gd); <pos><i>p. pr. [uCode: vb. n.</i></pos> <u>Digging</u>. --\r <i>Digged</i> is archaic.] [OE. <i>diggen</i>, perh. the same word as\r <i>diken</i>, <i>diche', 411, 0),
