(31083, 'ecliptic', 'Ecliptic', 'ecliptic', '<i>n.</i>', 'E*clip\"tic', '([uCode:esl]*kl[uCode:ibreve]p\"t[uCode:ibreve]k)', '[Cf. F. <i>[uCode:eacute]cliptique</i>, L. <i>linea\r ecliptica</i>, Gr. <grk>\'ekleiptiko`s</grk>, prop. adj., of an\r eclipse, because in this circle eclipses of the sun and moon take\r place. See <u>Ecliptic</u>, <pos><i>a.</i></pos>]', 469, 0),
