(34801, 'exalt', 'Exalt', 'exalt', '<i>v. t.</i>', 'Ex*alt\"', '(?)', '[<pos><i>imp. [uCode: p.\r p.</i></pos> <u>Exalted</u>] <pos><i>p. pr. [uCode: vb. n.</i></pos>\r <u>Exalting</u>.] [L. <i>exaltare</i>] <i>ex</i> out (intens.) +\r <i>altare</i> to make high, <i>altus</i> high: cf.F. <i>exalter</i>.\r See <u>Altitude</u>.]', 519, 0),
