(34807, 'examen', 'Examen', 'examen', '<i>n.</i>', 'Ex*a\"men', '(?)', '[L., the tongue of a\r balance, examination; for <i>exagmen</i>, fr. <i>exigere</i> to weigh\r accurately, to treat: cf. F. <i>examen</i>. See <u>Exact</u>,\r <pos><i>a.</i></pos>]', 519, 0),
