(34820, 'example', 'Example', 'example', '<i>n.</i>', 'Ex*am\"ple', '(?)', '[A later form for\r <i>ensample</i>, fr. L. <i>exemplum</i>, orig., what is taken out of\r a larger quantity, as a <i>sample</i>, from <i>eximere</i> to take\r out. See <u>Exempt</u>, and cf. <u>Ensample</u>, <u>Sample</u>.]', 519, 0),
