(35102, 'exempt', 'Exempt', 'exempt', '<i>a.</i>', 'Ex*empt\"', '(?)', '[F. <i>exempt</i>, L.\r <i>exemptus</i>, p. p. of <i>eximere</i> to take out, remove, free;\r <i>ex</i> out + <i>emere</i> to buy, take.  Cf. <u>Exon</u>,\r <u>Redeem</u>.]', 523, 0),
