(36303, 'farther', 'Farther', 'farther', '<i>a.</i>', 'Far\"ther', '(f[uCode:auml]r\"[uCode:thlig][uCode:etilde]r)', ', <pos><i>compar.</i></pos> of <u>Far</u>.\r [<pos><i>superl.</i></pos> <u>Farthest</u> (-[uCode:thlig][uCode:ebreve]st). See\r <u>Further</u>.] [For <i>farrer</i>, OE. <i>ferrer</i>, compar. of\r <i>far</i>; confused with <i>further</i>.  Cf. <u>Farthest</u', 544, 0),
