(42683, 'grammar', 'Grammar', 'grammar', '<i>n.</i>', 'Gram\"mar', '(?)', '[OE. <i>gramere</i>,\r OF. <i>gramaire</i>, F. <i>grammaire</i> Prob. fr. L.\r <i>gramatica</i> Gr [uCode:?], fem. of [uCode:?] skilled in grammar, fr. [uCode:?]\r letter. See <u>Gramme</u>, <u>Graphic</u>, and cf.\r <u>Grammatical</u>, <u>Gramarye</u>.]', 644, 0),
