(42695, 'grammatist', 'Grammatist', 'grammatist', '<i>n.</i>', 'Gram\"ma*tist', '(?)', '[L.\r <i>grammatista</i> schoolmaster, Gr. &?], from [uCode:?] to teach the\r letters, to be a scribe: cf. F. <i>grammatiste</i>. See\r <u>Grammatical</u>.]', 644, 0),
