(42698, 'grampus', 'Grampus', 'grampus', '<i>n.</i>', 'Gram\"pus', '(?)', '; <i>pl.</i>\r <plw><b>Grampuses</b></plw> (#). [Probably corrupted from It. <i>gran\r pesce</i> great fish, or Sp. <i>gran pez</i>, or Pg. <i>gran\r peixe</i>, all fr. L. <i>grandis piscis</i>. See <u>Grand</u>, and\r <u>Fish</u>. the animal.]', 644, 0),
