(42904, 'gris', 'Gris', 'gris', '<i>a.</i>', '||Gris', '(?)', '[OF. [uCode: F., fr. LL.\r <i>griseus</i>] of German origin; cf. MHG. <i>gris</i>, G.\r <i>greis</i>, hoary.  Cf. <u>Grizzle</u>.]', 651, 0),
