(53776, 'june', 'June', 'june', '<i>n.</i>', 'June', '(?)', '[L. <i>Junius</i>: cf. F.\r <i>Juin</i>. So called either from <i>Junius</i>, the name of a Roman\r gens, or from <i>Juno</i>, the goddess.]', 805, 0),
