(64171, 'mundane', 'Mundane', 'mundane', '<i>a.</i>', 'Mun\"dane', '(?)', '[L. <i>mundanus</i>,\r fr. <i>mundus</i> the world, an implement, toilet adornments, or\r dress; cf. <i>mundus</i>, a., clean, neat, Skr.\r <i>ma[uCode:nsdot][uCode:dsdot]</i> to adorn, dress, <i>ma[uCode:nsdot][uCode:dsdot]a</i>\r adornment.  Cf. <u>Monde</u', 954, 0),
