(65570, 'nice', 'Nice', 'nice', '<i>a.</i>', 'Nice', '(?)', '[<pos><i>Compar.</i></pos>\r <u>Nicer</u> (?); <pos><i>superl.</i></pos> <u>Nicest</u>.] [OE.,\r foolish, fr. OF. <i>nice</i> ignorant, fool, fr. L. <i>nescius</i>\r ignorant; <i>ne</i> not + <i>scius</i> knowing, <i>scire</i> to know.\r perhaps influenced by', 974, 0),
