(65578, 'nick', 'Nick', 'nick', '<i>n.</i>', 'Nick', '([uCode:?])', '[AS. <i>nicor</i> a\r marine monster; akin to D. <i>nikker</i> a water spite, Icel.\r <i>nykr</i>, ONG. <i>nihhus</i> a crocodile, G. <i>nix</i> a water\r sprite; cf. Gr. [uCode:?] to wash, Skr. <i>nij</i>.  Cf. <u>Nix</u>.]\r <i>(Northern Myth.)</i>', 974, 0),
