(65596, 'nickname', 'Nickname', 'nickname', '<i>n.</i>', 'Nick\"name`', '(?)', '[OE. <i>ekename</i>\r surname, hence, a nickname, <i>an ekename</i> being understood as\r <i>a nekename</i>, influenced also by E. <i>nick</i>, v. See\r <u>Eke</u>, and <u>Name</u>.]', 974, 0),
