(70567, 'pantomime', 'Pantomime', 'pantomime', '<i>n.</i>', 'Pan\"to*mime', '(?)', '[F., fr. L.\r <i>pantomimus</i>, Gr. [uCode:?], lit., all-imitating; [uCode:?], [uCode:?], all + [uCode:?]\r to imitate: cf. It. <i>pantomimo</i>. See <u>Mimic</u>.]', 1037, 0),
