(70878, 'parasite', 'Parasite', 'parasite', '<i>n.</i>', 'Par\"a*site', '(?)', '[F., fr. L.\r <i>parasitus</i>, Gr. [uCode:?], lit., eating beside, or at the table of,\r another; <grk>para`</grk> beside + [uCode:?] to feed, from [uCode:?] wheat, grain,\r food.]</p>\r \r <p>', 1042, 0),
