(78845, 'provide', 'Provide', 'provide', '<i>v. t.</i>', 'Pro*vide\"', '(?)', '[<pos><i>imp. [uCode: p.\r p.</i></pos> <u>Provided</u>] <pos><i>p. pr. [uCode: vb. n.</i></pos>\r <u>Providing</u>.] [L. <i>providere</i>, <i>provisum</i>] <i>pro</i>\r before + <i>videre</i> to see. See <u>Vision</u>, and cf.\r <u>Prudent</u>, <u>Purvey</u>', 1154, 0),
