(99147, 'tadpole', 'Tadpole', 'tadpole', '<i>n.</i>', 'Tad\"pole`', '(?)', '[OE. <i>tadde</i> toad (AS.\r <i>t[uCode:amacr]die</i>, <i>t[uCode:amacr]dige</i>) + <i>poll</i>; properly, a toad\r that is or seems all head. See <u>Toad</u>, and <u>Poll</u>.]', 1468, 0),
