(101720, 'time', 'Time', 'time', '<i>n.</i>', 'Time', '(?)', '; <i>pl.</i>\r <plw><b>Times</b></plw> (#). [OE. <i>time</i>, AS. <i>t[uCode:imacr]ma</i>, akin\r to <i>t[uCode:imacr]d</i> time, and to Icel. <i>t[uCode:imacr]mi</i>, Dan. <i>time</i>\r an hour, Sw. <i>timme</i>. [uCode:radic]58. See <u>Tide</u>,\r ]', 1510, 0),
