(103198, 'treat', 'Treat', 'treat', '<i>v. t.</i>', 'Treat', '(?)', '[<pos><i>imp. [uCode: p.\r p.</i></pos> <u>Treated</u>] <pos><i>p. pr. [uCode: vb. n.</i></pos>\r <u>Treating</u>.] [<u>OE</u>. <i>treten</i>, OF. <i>traitier</i>, F.\r <i>traiter</i>, from L. <i>tractare</i> to draw violently, to handle,\r manage, treat, v.', 1533, 0),
