(104654, 'twilight', 'Twilight', 'twilight', '<i>n.</i>', 'Twi\"light`', '(?)', '[OE. <i>twilight</i>, AS.\r <i>twi-</i> (see <u>Twice</u>) + <i>le[uCode:oacute]ht</i> light; hence the sense\r of doubtful or half light; cf. LG. <i>twelecht</i>, G. <i>zwielicht</i>.\r See <u>Light</u>.]</p>\r \r <p>', 1556, 0),
