(104993, 'umbrage', 'Umbrage', 'umbrage', '<i>n.</i>', 'Um\"brage', '(?; 48)', '[F. <i>ombrage</i>\r shade, suspicion, umbrage, L. <i>umbraticus</i> belonging to shade, fr.\r <i>umbra</i> a shade.  Cf. <u>Umber</u>, <u>Umbratic</u>.]', 1562, 0),
