(107529, 'valance', 'Valance', 'valance', '<i>n.</i>', 'Val\"ance', '(?)', '[Perhaps fr. OF.\r <i>avalant</i> descending, hanging down, p. pr. of <i>avaler</i> to go\r down, let down, descent (cf. <u>Avalanche</u>); but probably from the town\r of <i>Valence</i> in France.]</p>\r \r <p>', 1591, 0),
