(107800, 'vast', 'Vast', 'vast', '<i>a.</i>', 'Vast', '(?)', '[<pos><i>Compar.</i></pos>\r <u>Vaster</u> (?); <pos><i>superl.</i></pos> <u>Vastest</u>.] [L.\r <i>vastus</i> empty, waste, enormous, immense: cf. F. <i>vaste</i>. See\r <u>Waste</u>, and cf. <u>Devastate</u>.]</p>\r \r <p>', 1596, 0),
