(107824, 'vaudeville', 'Vaudeville', 'vaudeville', '<i>n.</i>', '||Vaude\"ville', '(?)', '[F., fr. <i>Vau-de-\r vire</i>, a village in Normandy, where Olivier Basselin, at the end of the\r 14th century, composed such songs.] [Written also <i>vaudevil</i>.]</p>\r \r <p>', 1597, 0),
