(108163, 'verify', 'Verify', 'verify', '<i>v. t.</i>', 'Ver\"i*fy', '(?)', '[<pos><i>imp. [uCode: p.\r p.</i></pos> <u>Verified</u> (?)] <pos><i>p. pr. [uCode: vb. n.</i></pos>\r <u>Verifying</u>.] [F. <i>v&eacute]rifier</i>, LL. <i>verificare</i>, from\r L. <i>verus</i> true + <i>-ficare</i> to make.  See <u>Very</u>, and <i>-\r fy<', 1603, 0),
