(111295, 'wither', 'Wither', 'wither', '<i>v. i.</i>', 'With\"er', '(?)', '[<pos><i>imp. & p.\r p.</i></pos> <u>Withered</u> (?)] <pos><i>p. pr. [uCode: vb. n.</i></pos>\r <u>Withering</u>.] [OE. <i>wideren</i>] probably the same word as\r <i>wederen</i> to weather (see <u>Weather</u>, <pos><i>v.</i></pos> [uCode:\r <pos><i>n.</i></', 1659, 0),
