(111304, 'withers', 'Withers', 'withers', '<i>n. pl.</i>', 'With\"ers', '(?)', '[Properly, the parts\r which resist the pull or strain in drawing a load; fr. OE. <i>wither</i>\r resistance, AS. <i>wi[uCode:eth]re</i>, fr. <i>wi[uCode:eth]er</i> against; akin to G.\r <i>wider</i>rist withers.  See <u>With</u>, <pos><i>prep.</i></pos>]', 1660, 0),
