(111349, 'witwal', 'Witwal', 'witwal', '<i>n.</i>', 'Wit\"wal`', ' (?)', '[Akin to G. <i>wittewal</i>, <i>wiedewall</i>, MHG. <i>witewal</i>, D.\r <i>wiedewaal</i>, <i>wielewaal</i>, OD. <i>weduwael</i>, and perhaps the\r same word as OE. <i>wodewale</i>.  Cf. <u>Wood</u>, ,\r <u>Wittol</u>.] <i>(Zo[uCode:ouml]l.)</i> <sd><i>(a)</', 1660, 1),
